flows, HMAC headers, env vars, import steps, error workflow.\\n\\n### 4. Create minimal but valid n8n workflow JSON stubs (secret-free) under `n8n/workflows/`:\\n- `wf1-profile-extraction.json`\\n- `wf2-discovery-match.json`\\n- `wf3-asset-customization.json`\\n- `wf4-inbound-email.json`\\n- `wf-error-handler.json`\\n\\nEach should be a simplified n8n workflow export shape:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"...\\\",\\n  \\\"nodes\\\": [\\n    { \\\"parameters\\\": {}, \\\"id\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Schedule/Webhook\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger\\\" or webhook, \\\"typeVersion\\\": 1, \\\"position\\\": [0,0] },\\n    { \\\"parameters\\\": { \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"={{$env.APPLYOS_BASE_URL}}/api/internal/automation\\\", \\\"sendHeaders\\\": true, \\\"headerParameters\\\": { \\\"parameters\\\": [\\n      {\\\"name\\\":\\\"x-n8n-webhook-secret\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"={{$env.N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET}}\\\"},\\n      {\\\"name\\\":\\\"content-type\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"application/json\\\"}\\n    ]}, \\\"sendBody\\\": true, \\\"specifyBody\\\": \\\"json\\\", \\\"jsonBody\\\": \\\"={...}\\\" }, \\\"name\\\": \\\"HTTP Request\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\\\", \\\"typeVersion\\\": 4, \\\"position\\\": [300,0] }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"connections\\\": { ... },\\n  \\\"active\\\": false,\\n  \\\"settings\\\": {},\\n  \\\"meta\\\": { \\\"templateCredsSetupCompleted\\\": false }\\n}\\n```\\n\\nMake bodies use expressions for userId/idempotencyKey. Document placeholders USER_UUID, JOB_SOURCE_UUID.\\n\\n### 5. `docs/N8N_CONTRACTS.md`\\nEvent catalog with example payloads for each event.\\n\\nWrite complete files. TypeScript strict.\"}","result_json":"{}","duration":25.867,"mcp_server_name":"extension-ace-pattern-learning","session_id":"e4448726-4207-4d09-80a7-e793a5502c6d","hook_event_name":"afterMCPExecution","cursor_version":"3.14.27","workspace_roots":["/Users/bmoir/Desktop/applyos/applyOS"],"user_email":"bmoir2@